description: Supabase client and RLS safety for Fleet
globs: src/lib/supabase.ts,src/**/*Api.ts,supabase/**/*
alwaysApply: false
---

# Supabase data rules

- Browser code may use only the anon key via `src/lib/supabase.ts`.
- Never add `service_role` keys to Vite env vars or commit them.
- Every new table must enable RLS and policies scoped with `auth.uid() = user_id`.
- Keep TypeScript row types in `src/lib/database.types.ts` aligned with migrations.
- Prefer feature `*Api.ts` helpers over calling `supabase.from(...)` directly in components.
